WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:17.944
Meeting someone is surely

00:17.944 --> 00:21.114
The dawn within our hearts

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
And a new breeze is born from there

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Once you've realized you're not alone

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
The translucent Moon will smile

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Then, the prelude you can hear in your spirit

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Is a nostalgic but unusual song

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Surely

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Everyone is born so that they can meet someone

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, out into the boundless world...

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Yes, so we may search for love

01:32.184 --> 01:33.424
The Moon.

01:33.424 --> 01:35.954
Neither distant nor forgotten,

01:35.954 --> 01:39.324
it is the Earth's neighbor, so near and yet so far.

01:40.394 --> 01:45.934
Thus, the brave pioneers whose dreams
held visions of this white orb

01:45.934 --> 01:49.594
set out in order to make it their second home.

01:50.574 --> 01:52.804
Sphere Kingdom.

01:52.804 --> 01:56.174
That was the name of this new world.

01:56.274 --> 01:57.714
However...

01:58.884 --> 02:01.554
Rain down the Fires of Heaven
upon those vermin

02:01.554 --> 02:03.954
who would extend their filthy reach
to our sacred land!

02:04.024 --> 02:07.684
These lunar aliens with their God complexes
need to be exterminated!

02:07.994 --> 02:09.354
Fire!

02:14.634 --> 02:19.394
Thus began the Oedipus War,
called the most brutal battle in history.

03:21.764 --> 03:26.704
The close of the war finally brought an end
to the foolish conflict.

03:26.764 --> 03:31.674
Wounds that would never heal
remained on both sides...

03:34.474 --> 03:37.034
And once again, time passed.

03:38.714 --> 03:39.114
- Episode 1-
The Princess
Does a Homestay?!

03:39.114 --> 03:41.384
- Episode 1-
The Princess
Does a Homestay?!
The Princess Does a Homestay?!

03:41.384 --> 03:44.014
- Episode 1-
The Princess
Does a Homestay?!

03:45.784 --> 03:49.314
Princess, see how big the Earth looks!

03:49.594 --> 03:53.054
It looks so, SO much bigger
than from our kingdom!

03:53.264 --> 03:57.794
Mia, if you keep leaning forward like that,
you're going to hit your face.

03:59.034 --> 04:01.234
I-I'm terribly sorry.

04:02.904 --> 04:07.134
Still, watching you somehow
makes me excited as well.

04:08.144 --> 04:09.914
But Princess, you've...

04:09.914 --> 04:13.944
The last time I went, I was still just a child.

04:14.054 --> 04:15.584
Oh, is that so?

04:15.584 --> 04:16.554
Yes.

04:20.424 --> 04:23.824
"Mitsurugasaki, the seat of the
Federation Government headquarters,

04:23.824 --> 04:26.324
"has essentially closed its borders
and developed into

04:26.324 --> 04:29.764
"a center of foreign diplomacy
with the lunar kingdom.

04:30.664 --> 04:36.874
"As a central lunar port city equipped
with the sole landing facilities

04:36.874 --> 04:39.244
"connecting the lunar embassy
with reentry-capable craft,

04:39.244 --> 04:43.804
"it can quite literally be called the gateway
between the Earth and the Moon.

04:44.644 --> 04:48.714
"Currently, while tension between the
two governments has temporarily abated,

04:48.714 --> 04:52.954
"the state of relations between
them remains tenuous at best."

04:52.954 --> 04:55.514
Okay, good! Next is...

04:59.194 --> 05:01.024
Well, that's all for today.

05:06.134 --> 05:07.934
You ready to go, Natsuki?

05:11.744 --> 05:14.714
C'mon, get up! You have to work today, right?

05:19.414 --> 05:20.844
Greetings, customer...

05:22.284 --> 05:25.944
Greetings, customer!
Welcome to Trattoria Samon!

05:28.894 --> 05:29.944
Good morning.

05:34.594 --> 05:37.034
I swear. That was YOUR fault, Tatsuya!

05:37.034 --> 05:40.204
You were the one who wouldn't
wake up any other way.

05:40.204 --> 05:42.174
Th-that's not my fault!

05:42.174 --> 05:46.074
Intro to Lunar Studies has nothing to do with
our exams and just makes me sleepy!

05:46.074 --> 05:48.114
That doesn't happen to me...

05:48.114 --> 05:50.774
That's because you like it!

05:52.084 --> 05:56.984
You've been that way since we were kids.
Is it because of your dad?

05:56.984 --> 05:59.784
Maybe, I don't know.

06:02.854 --> 06:04.264
That sound...

06:04.264 --> 06:05.484
It's Mai!

06:12.104 --> 06:13.694
Big Brother!

06:16.234 --> 06:18.044
Are you both going to work now?

06:18.044 --> 06:19.144
Yeah.

06:19.144 --> 06:20.974
You're practicing hard aren't you, Mai?

06:21.974 --> 06:24.534
Well, we had some new students
join our club, so...

06:24.614 --> 06:26.584
Oh. How responsible of you.

06:30.724 --> 06:32.724
Brother, I swear!

06:32.724 --> 06:36.054
It's embarrassing when you
do that here at school!

06:37.124 --> 06:42.264
Now now, Mai. That's how he always shows
affection toward his hardworking younger sister.

06:42.264 --> 06:45.364
That's right. Mai's really working hard!

06:45.364 --> 06:49.034
She's been made flute co-lead!

06:49.034 --> 06:50.594
Toyama Senpai!

06:50.904 --> 06:51.944
Midori!

06:51.944 --> 06:53.964
What're you doing here, Toyama?

06:54.844 --> 06:57.814
Hey! Midori's a member of the
wind instrument club too, right?!

06:57.814 --> 07:01.684
That's right! Miss Toyama plays lead clarinet.

07:02.754 --> 07:05.184
And to think we've been in the same class
since our freshman year...

07:05.184 --> 07:09.724
Uh, you're always practicing your clarinet
in the hallway, right? So...

07:09.724 --> 07:11.794
As long as you've noticed, it's okay!

07:11.794 --> 07:15.164
I just came to check up
on my junior student here...

07:16.134 --> 07:17.134
Is something the matter?

07:17.134 --> 07:21.234
You'll do it to Mai and Natsuki
but you won't do it to me!

07:21.234 --> 07:24.604
That's just a bad habit of Tatsuya's
from long ago.

07:24.604 --> 07:26.274
I wonder if it's really that bad...

07:26.274 --> 07:29.214
Anyway, are you two doing okay on time?

07:31.414 --> 07:34.054
Tatsuya! We're going to have to hurry!

07:34.054 --> 07:35.714
Okay, we're off.

07:40.284 --> 07:42.354
We got here a little early, huh?

07:42.354 --> 07:44.894
Really? Well, let's change first before we go.

07:44.894 --> 07:45.914
Okay!

07:50.234 --> 07:51.354
I'm home.

07:53.404 --> 07:54.734
Channel 25.

07:57.004 --> 07:58.404
And now the news.

07:58.404 --> 07:59.274
From Big Sis?

07:59.274 --> 07:59.374
Dear Tatsuya and Mai
There's something I'd like to talk to you both
about, so please don't do any of tonight's
dinner prep and just wait for me at home.
I already let Mr. Samon know.
Signed, Sayaka.
From Big Sis?

07:59.374 --> 08:02.014
Dear Tatsuya and Mai
There's something I'd like to talk to you both
about, so please don't do any of tonight's
dinner prep and just wait for me at home.
I already let Mr. Samon know.
Signed, Sayaka.
Dear Tatsuya and Mai,

08:03.014 --> 08:05.884
There's something I'd like to talk
to you both about,

08:05.884 --> 08:09.814
so please don't do any of tonight's dinner prep
and just wait for me at home.

08:09.914 --> 08:13.154
I already let Mr. Samon know.

08:14.294 --> 08:15.724
Signed, Sayaka.

08:16.454 --> 08:16.854
In other news...

08:16.854 --> 08:17.994
I wonder what this is about.
In other news...

08:17.994 --> 08:21.094
Talks opened between President Bridget Amber
of the Federation Government

08:21.094 --> 08:27.434
and Karen Clavius, military attaché
of Sphere Kingdom.

08:27.604 --> 08:33.044
The President will be holding a
conference on this at a later date,

08:33.044 --> 08:36.204
and as such, I can't comment on
any particulars at this time.

08:36.514 --> 08:43.214
The details of the meeting remain top secret, with Miss
Sayaka Hozumi remaining tight-lipped on the subject.

08:43.354 --> 08:47.154
My cousin looks all official,
but when I see that face,

08:47.154 --> 08:49.454
I can't help but want to call her my big sis.

08:49.724 --> 08:51.124
In other news...

08:51.924 --> 08:53.154
It's about that time.

08:54.494 --> 08:56.264
Greetings, customer!

08:56.264 --> 08:57.924
Oh, it's only Tatsuya.

08:59.364 --> 09:01.304
Look, just forget that ever happened!

09:01.304 --> 09:03.504
Well good morning, Tatsuya!

09:03.504 --> 09:06.404
Good morning Sir, Jin.

09:06.404 --> 09:08.844
Hey there. We'll be counting on you today.

09:08.844 --> 09:10.144
By the way,

09:10.144 --> 09:12.414
would you care to go into a bit of detail

09:12.414 --> 09:16.044
regarding that rather DEEP talk just now
with my younger sister?

09:16.154 --> 09:17.324
Brother!

09:17.324 --> 09:20.654
Jin, don't you still have prep work
to take care of?

09:20.654 --> 09:22.694
Oh, that's right.

09:22.694 --> 09:24.164
Very well, we'll continue this later.

09:24.164 --> 09:25.894
There's no need to!

09:25.894 --> 09:27.884
Hey! Wait!

09:28.134 --> 09:32.724
Tatsu, take care of cleaning up outside.
When you're done, turn the sign around.

09:32.934 --> 09:34.094
Yes, sir.

09:37.174 --> 09:39.034
Greetings, customer!

09:40.274 --> 09:42.174
Jin, here you are.

09:43.744 --> 09:46.014
Looks good.

09:47.854 --> 09:49.444
I'm counting on you!

09:49.984 --> 09:51.514
Order up!

09:53.624 --> 09:56.094
Thank you very much!

10:01.734 --> 10:03.924
Thank you very much!

10:05.464 --> 10:08.004
Hey! You can go, Tatsu.

10:08.004 --> 10:11.874
Yes, sir. Huh? But it's still 8:00.

10:12.274 --> 10:14.714
I sort of have an appointment after this.

10:14.714 --> 10:17.914
Sorry Jin and Natsuki, I'll have to ask you
to work a little longer.

10:17.914 --> 10:20.914
How come only Tatsuya gets to go?

10:20.914 --> 10:23.924
Sir, I'm good to keep going.

10:23.924 --> 10:27.614
Oh, don't mind us!
You just hurry up and head home!

10:30.694 --> 10:33.324
It looks like Mai and my sis are already back.

10:35.834 --> 10:36.954
I'm home!

10:37.864 --> 10:40.394
W-welcome back!

10:43.034 --> 10:45.174
My apologies. I have the wrong house.

10:45.174 --> 10:48.074
U-um, it's not a mistake!

10:48.244 --> 10:51.544
Uh, you're Master Tatsuya Asagiri, aren't you?

10:52.414 --> 10:55.114
Oh, welcome back, Tatsuya.

10:55.114 --> 10:56.984
Hi, Sis.

10:56.984 --> 10:59.754
I mean, no! Why's there a maid in our house?!

11:03.094 --> 11:05.154
Mai! Hey! What happened?!

11:07.224 --> 11:09.694
It looks like Mai got a pretty big shock.

11:09.964 --> 11:13.264
Sis, just what is all this about?

11:13.264 --> 11:15.674
The truth is... Ahem!

11:15.674 --> 11:20.134
Starting today, we've opened up
our house for a homestay!

11:22.174 --> 11:24.844
Ah. A homestay, huh?

11:25.284 --> 11:26.844
A homestay?!

11:26.844 --> 11:29.244
A-and starting today?!

11:32.054 --> 11:33.414
Is this for real?

11:34.254 --> 11:35.624
It's for real.

11:36.824 --> 11:40.724
I see your nickname of "The President's
Trusty Blade" isn't just for show.

11:41.494 --> 11:44.484
I wish you wouldn't call me that
alarming nickname and mean it!

11:45.304 --> 11:49.974
Still, she doesn't seem like the type
you'd take in for safekeeping.

11:49.974 --> 11:54.474
That's right. Mia here is just the servant.

11:54.474 --> 11:56.374
Servant? Whose?

11:56.574 --> 12:00.514
Tatsuya, you know about
Sphere Kingdom on the Moon, right?

12:00.514 --> 12:02.784
Yeah, I guess.

12:02.884 --> 12:06.554
Mia is the servant of the lunar princess.

12:06.554 --> 12:08.884
Oh, she's just the Princess's...

12:09.294 --> 12:10.124
Huh?

12:10.324 --> 12:12.314
Huh?!

12:16.934 --> 12:19.704
Oh no! I have to hurry and tell my brother...

12:19.704 --> 12:21.634
Huh? Brother?

12:23.104 --> 12:25.004
You already heard?

12:25.444 --> 12:27.134
U-um...

12:27.774 --> 12:31.544
Pleased to meet you. I'm Mia Clementis.

12:31.544 --> 12:34.314
I'm Tatsuya Asagiri. Pleased to meet you.

12:34.314 --> 12:36.874
The Princess and I are in your debt.

12:37.654 --> 12:40.024
Speaking of, where is the Princess?

12:40.024 --> 12:42.994
Right now she's moon gazing out in the garden.

12:44.194 --> 12:48.564
Princess Feena! It may be spring,
but the night breeze could give you a chill.

13:02.814 --> 13:04.884
My apologies, Sayaka.

13:04.884 --> 13:07.784
I lost track of time while watching.

13:08.014 --> 13:11.324
Tatsuya, this is the lunar princess...

13:11.324 --> 13:15.154
I apologize for not introducing myself sooner.

13:15.154 --> 13:19.454
I am Feena Fam Earthlight,
princess of Sphere Kingdom.

13:19.694 --> 13:24.964
As of today, we are in your debt.
My deepest thanks.

13:25.134 --> 13:29.134
Uh, y-yes! I am Tatsuya Asagiri!

13:29.134 --> 13:32.404
Please accept our humble hospitality!

13:32.404 --> 13:35.114
Well, we should be getting inside.

13:35.114 --> 13:36.334
Yes.

13:46.784 --> 13:49.554
I have studied your Earth customs.

14:00.464 --> 14:01.934
Mistress Feena!

14:03.074 --> 14:05.904
I am fine, Mia. No need to worry.

14:05.904 --> 14:07.464
But...

14:15.614 --> 14:17.674
Tetsuya, no!

14:19.424 --> 14:21.184
I'm terribly sorry!

14:21.494 --> 14:24.584
He tweaked... the princess's nose!

14:25.264 --> 14:28.564
Insolent cur! Death to the lot of them!

14:33.334 --> 14:36.034
We're going to get the death penalty?!

14:37.504 --> 14:40.404
As his guardian, I accept responsibility.

14:40.404 --> 14:43.274
Princess Feena, please, show mercy!

14:47.284 --> 14:50.824
I'm very sorry! All blame for this
rudeness lies with me!

14:50.824 --> 14:52.614
These two had nothing to do with it!

14:52.784 --> 14:54.584
Madam Princess...

14:55.254 --> 14:57.124
May I ask why you did this?

14:57.124 --> 15:02.194
Um, w-well, it's a strange habit my brother
has had since he was a child.

15:02.194 --> 15:04.234
He doesn't do it to just anyone.

15:04.234 --> 15:06.994
It's, shall we say, an unconscious way
of expressing affection?

15:08.374 --> 15:11.034
Please raise your head, Sir Tatsuya.

15:12.944 --> 15:18.744
In my kingdom, there is no law that treats the
expression of affection as a crime of disrespect.

15:20.044 --> 15:21.814
I'm so glad!

15:21.954 --> 15:25.754
I swear, Tatsuya, that just took
a few years off of my life!

15:25.754 --> 15:28.654
I'm sorry, both of you, for making you worry.

15:28.654 --> 15:31.754
Honestly, Tatsuya, I swear!

15:32.094 --> 15:34.224
He hasn't changed at all, has he?

15:36.264 --> 15:38.164
That was wrong of you, Sayaka.

15:38.164 --> 15:43.374
I thought not preparing them for it would
keep them from over-thinking things.

15:43.374 --> 15:46.204
You're the only person who'd think
something like that!

15:46.204 --> 15:51.014
You're just as Karen and your
Madam President described, Sayaka.

15:51.014 --> 15:53.644
Did you meet through the
President's introduction?

15:53.644 --> 15:54.754
Yes.

15:54.754 --> 15:58.424
I called upon her having heard that she was a
trustworthy member of the Federal Government,

15:58.424 --> 16:00.454
and had even spent time as a
student on the Moon.

16:00.454 --> 16:03.914
And what will you be doing here on Earth,
Princess Feena?

16:04.364 --> 16:09.934
As the next queen to the throne, and to create
better ties between the Earth and the Moon,

16:09.934 --> 16:13.954
I must learn more about your world. Therefore...

16:14.104 --> 16:18.404
Preparations for your student exchange
at Caterina Academy are complete.

16:19.544 --> 16:23.874
Starting tomorrow, Princess Feena will be
a third-year student at the academy.

16:23.874 --> 16:27.374
I made sure she's in the same class as you,
so keep an eye on her, will you?

16:27.684 --> 16:33.154
I apologize if I am a burden to you,
but I too ask your help, Sir Tatsuya.

16:33.154 --> 16:34.524
Yes, ma'am!

16:36.554 --> 16:39.424
U-um, I'm terribly sorry!

16:39.624 --> 16:43.634
Actually, I haven't eaten anything since
work finished today either.

16:43.634 --> 16:45.604
Neither have I...

16:48.434 --> 16:53.874
Let's worry about assigning rooms
and so on later and eat dinner together.

16:53.874 --> 16:56.474
But nothing's ready!

16:56.474 --> 17:00.514
No need to worry!
I've already made reservations.

17:00.514 --> 17:01.754
Reservations?

17:01.754 --> 17:04.114
Oh, so that's what it was about!

17:06.184 --> 17:07.854
It's a lovely restaurant, isn't it?

17:07.854 --> 17:10.184
Yes, it's very lovely!

17:11.464 --> 17:13.924
What are you so mad about, Natsuki?

17:13.924 --> 17:16.234
Why don't you try asking yourself that question?!

17:16.234 --> 17:20.534
Hmm, all I can think of is calling your
squid ink pasta "charcoal pasta".

17:20.534 --> 17:22.164
Princess Feena, please forgive us!

17:22.304 --> 17:23.434
Wh-what are you doing?!

17:23.604 --> 17:24.444
That's it!

17:24.444 --> 17:25.994
Oh, that?

17:29.814 --> 17:32.674
Jin, you're paying for that out of your salary!

17:33.184 --> 17:37.384
Ah, such a vicious manner of showing her love
doth mine sister have.

17:40.994 --> 17:42.994
I take it you all have reservations, yes?

17:42.994 --> 17:45.224
Welcome to Trattoria Samon.

17:45.364 --> 17:49.164
Come, come. Now escorting
the lunar princess's party!

17:49.264 --> 17:50.954
Welcome
Princess Feena &
Miss Mia!

17:52.404 --> 17:54.924
It is an honor to meet you, Princess.

17:55.204 --> 17:58.074
I am the chef of this humble establishment,
Samon Takamizawa.

17:58.074 --> 18:00.374
I'm Natsuki Takamizawa.

18:00.374 --> 18:03.844
Tatsuya there is my childhood friend
and is in the same class as me...

18:03.844 --> 18:06.374
And they bathed together up
until they were five years old.

18:08.184 --> 18:10.384
SHUT
UP!
And this is my poor excuse for an older brother.

18:10.384 --> 18:13.714
SHUT
UP!
Jin Takamizawa. It is an honor, Madam.

18:13.954 --> 18:17.864
They've always treated us like part of the family.

18:17.864 --> 18:19.864
Okay, let's eat!

18:19.864 --> 18:21.124
Agreed!

18:23.394 --> 18:27.024
Today, your big sis is splurging and
treating you all to a full course meal!

18:27.934 --> 18:30.274
Um, is there something on my face?

18:30.274 --> 18:32.574
N-no, not at all.

18:32.574 --> 18:34.104
Here, have some juice.

18:34.104 --> 18:36.374
Thank you very much, Miss Natsuki.

18:38.044 --> 18:39.684
Here, Tatsuya.

18:39.684 --> 18:41.354
Thank you, Natsuki.

18:41.354 --> 18:45.284
But hey, that was pretty mean of you!
Not telling me about Princess Feena...

18:45.284 --> 18:47.924
I didn't know about it myself!

18:47.924 --> 18:50.924
I first heard about it a little while ago,
and I was so surprised!

18:50.924 --> 18:53.724
Well then, I would like to propose a toast.

18:53.724 --> 18:54.994
If I may...

18:56.264 --> 18:59.764
To these most beautiful of angels,
who have descended from the silvery Moon...

18:59.764 --> 19:00.264
And to pure white lace!
To these most beautiful of angels,
who have descended from the silvery Moon...

19:00.264 --> 19:01.394
And to pure white lace!

19:03.304 --> 19:05.504
Th-there's something in my skirt!

19:05.504 --> 19:05.994
Feena!

19:07.644 --> 19:09.334
Captured on film!

19:09.614 --> 19:11.574
That face is today's best shot!

19:11.914 --> 19:13.714
Staff! Where is my staff?!

19:13.714 --> 19:15.704
Right here, Boss!

19:17.184 --> 19:18.514
Sorry to keep you waiting!

19:19.284 --> 19:21.254
Develop this in three seconds.

19:21.254 --> 19:22.244
Yes, Boss!

19:30.864 --> 19:34.474
Not bad... work if you can find it.

19:34.474 --> 19:36.134
Just who are you?!

19:37.174 --> 19:39.074
Don't you know me, young'un?

19:39.844 --> 19:43.074
Mr. Takano, enough is enough.

19:43.614 --> 19:47.014
Could it be... Are you Mr. Takano
the visual artiste?

19:47.014 --> 19:50.814
The same. Takeshi Takano, in the flesh.

19:50.814 --> 19:52.954
Uncle, you know this man?

19:52.954 --> 19:56.754
He is a renowned master, a
world-class creator of visual media!

19:57.054 --> 20:00.654
His "Thus Spoke the Olive" is my bible!

20:01.094 --> 20:03.494
I'm terribly sorry about all this.

20:03.494 --> 20:08.004
Mr. Takano is the only person my father
approved to report on my homestay.

20:08.004 --> 20:10.164
Thank you!
Mr. Takano is the only person my father
approved to report on my homestay.

20:10.474 --> 20:13.204
I got me connections in Sphere Kingdom!

20:13.404 --> 20:16.214
Sorry, I forgot to mention this.

20:16.214 --> 20:17.444
Sis...

20:17.444 --> 20:19.914
But why was he under her skirt?

20:19.914 --> 20:23.544
He comes and goes quite unexpectedly.
I've grown used to it.

20:25.684 --> 20:28.654
Also, I've known him since the time
of my grandfather.

20:28.894 --> 20:30.384
Yeah, but still...

20:31.424 --> 20:32.894
Jin?

20:33.094 --> 20:36.034
There is one thing I would ask you...

20:37.534 --> 20:39.764
When you said "pure white lace,"
did you mean?

20:41.104 --> 20:41.674
GR!
Get outta here!

20:41.674 --> 20:43.034
Get outta here!

20:43.204 --> 20:44.674
Spoon!

20:44.674 --> 20:44.774
SEXUAL
HARASSMENT!

20:44.774 --> 20:47.774
SEXUAL
HARASSMENT!
Jin! That's coming out of your pay again!

20:47.774 --> 20:48.944
SEXUAL
HARASSMENT!

20:48.944 --> 20:50.414
SEXUAL
HARASSMENT!
This is a lotta fun!

20:51.884 --> 20:55.574
He may be fond of pranks,
but he's not a bad person.

20:55.784 --> 20:58.424
I'll take your word, Princess Feena.

20:58.424 --> 21:02.554
By the way, Sir Tatsuya,
earlier you called me simply "Feena".

21:02.554 --> 21:05.924
Ah! Uh, it just suddenly popped out...

21:05.924 --> 21:09.454
If possible, would you mind please
calling me that from now on?

21:10.264 --> 21:11.124
But...

21:11.504 --> 21:14.434
It is a homestay after all, and...

21:14.434 --> 21:17.804
It would put me at ease to feel accepted
as part of the family.

21:17.804 --> 21:21.364
If you'd be kind enough to call me "Tatsuya".

21:21.714 --> 21:23.704
Understood, Tatsuya.

21:24.014 --> 21:26.414
To friendship, Feena.

21:27.344 --> 21:31.304
Ah! Big Brother and Princess Feena toasted,
just the two of them!

21:31.624 --> 21:34.214
Everyone, come on, let's toast together.

21:34.694 --> 21:38.594
I'd like to make the same request
of the others that I have of you.

21:38.594 --> 21:40.024
Yeah.

21:40.024 --> 21:41.684
Welcome to Earth.

21:43.394 --> 21:46.064
Cheers!

21:46.064 --> 21:47.794
Okay everyone, let's eat.

21:48.334 --> 21:50.704
Who was it? Who made the toast?!

21:50.704 --> 21:52.404
Well, it was me...

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
That platinum-colored crescent moon

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Stands still now, gently

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
I look up at the sky and think

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
That falling star is surely the Moon's tears

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
And I thought of you

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Why do I cry these tears?

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Though all I am doing is praying for eternity...

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
I want to walk with you, believing in the future

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
No matter how many times
the Moon waxes and wanes

23:25.164 --> 23:26.834
Preview

23:26.834 --> 23:28.674
Preview
I swear, I got my salary cut
in the very first episode.

23:28.674 --> 23:29.174
I swear, I got my salary cut
in the very first episode.

23:29.174 --> 23:31.344
Too bad they didn't cut your appearance, too.

23:31.344 --> 23:33.374
By the way, what should I do?

23:33.374 --> 23:35.174
For starters, a dance? Oh, a little dance...

23:35.174 --> 23:36.674
Just do the preview!

23:36.674 --> 23:37.044
- Episode 2-
The Princess is an A-Student!
Just do the preview!

23:37.044 --> 23:38.644
- Episode 2-
The Princess is an A-Student!
Okay, see ya next week!

23:38.644 --> 23:40.134
- Episode 2-
The Princess is an A-Student!
